<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-PacDun completes unit sale to St Jude.</title>
<headline>RTRS-PacDun completes unit sale to St Jude.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Dunlop Ltd said on Monday it had completed the A$170 million sale of its implantable medical device business to St Jude Medical Inc.</p>
<p>The diversified industrial company said the sale by its Telectronics Pacing Systems unit was concluded in Chicago on Novembr 29.</p>
<p>St Jude is based in St Paul, Minnesota.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61- 29373-1800</p>
</text>
